en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["实际上，你完全可以在实验室的终端里与我通话。技术部为每个研究员配给了最先进的通讯设备，我也有充分的精力查看你们每个人的消息。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"28":{"step":[[28,29,""]],"type":1,"name":["兔毛手袋","","Medicine Pocket","","","","",""],"head_icon":"304701.png","audio":"610017490","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["那我怎么能确认我提交的研究报告有没有躺在你们的垃圾箱里？得了吧，丑话得当面说才有用——","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"29":{"step":[[29,30,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["它手一甩，灰色的文件夹重重地落在桌面上。过大的力道使得内部的文件滑落一地。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"story_bg/1_7/1_7_bg_baoyuyanyanjiusuo2.jpg","choice":[]},"30":{"step":[[30,31,""]],"type":1,"name":["兔毛手袋","","Medicine Pocket","","","","",""],"head_icon":"304701.png","audio":"610017491","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["恭喜，你们对重塑之手面具研究的唯一成果——彻底搞清了它的副作用！拜它所赐，拉普拉斯的走廊快被石油和疯子淹了。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"31":{"step":[[31,32,""]],"type":1,"name":["兔毛手袋","","Medicine Pocket","","","","",""],"head_icon":"304701.png","audio":"610017492","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["你该感谢那个戴帽子的报时布谷鸟递交过报告，目前还没人被它转化为无心智的怪物。不然重塑之手就要从科算中心内部攻打总部了！","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"32":{"step":[[32,33,""]],"type":1,"name":["兔毛手袋","","Medicine Pocket","","","","",""],"head_icon":"304701.png","audio":"610017493","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["——该死的，你在做什么？你到底有没有听见我说话？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"33":{"step":[[33,35,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["露西女士转过头来，它刚刚扣上脸上的搭扣。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"35":{"step":[[35,36,""]],"type":1,"name":["露西","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"610017517","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["哦，抱歉。因为你刚刚说到“当面”。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"36":{"step":[[36,37,""]],"type":1,"name":["露西","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"610017518","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["如果我没有理解错的话，这应当是你的第一个要求。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"37":{"step":[[37,38,""]],"type":1,"name":["兔毛手袋","","Medicine Pocket","","","","",""],"head_icon":"304701.png","audio":"610017494","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["……你兜里总是揣着张脸？天啊，这可真是，贴心啊。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"38":{"step":[[38,39,""]],"type":1,"name":["露西","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"610017519","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["不客气，我们应充分了解并满足每个研究员的所需，促使他们的个性和天赋得以发展。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"39":{"step":[[39,40,""]],"type":1,"name":["露西","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"610017520","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["我收到了一些意见信，上面强烈要求我加强幽默感以听懂研究员们的讥讽。所以我正在学习。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"40":{"step":[[40,41,""]],"type":1,"name":["露西","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"610017521","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["有75%的信件上提到，他们不喜欢看到我有脸，甚至有部分人言辞激烈地反馈：“别让我看到你那张脸！”","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"41":{"step":[[41,42,""]],"type":1,"name":["露西","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"610017522","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["很高兴你属于剩下的25%，兔毛手袋研究员。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"42":{"step":[[42,43,""]],"type":1,"name":["兔毛手袋","","Medicine Pocket","","","","",""],"head_icon":"304701.png","audio":"610017495","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["你猜怎么着？我非常欢迎你装上脸，只要事后给我当室内足球踢几脚就行。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"43":{"step":[[43,44,